Spec: Aggregate server control counters

Purpose:
  Observe successful lease issuance, publisher verification and current-authority batch activity without credentials or scopes.

Owns:
  ./control_stats.go

Must:
  Record successful operations with saturating atomic UInt64 counters and expose immutable process-local snapshots only.
  Include no tokens, identities, paths, addresses or raw errors; do not add an unauthenticated network metrics endpoint.
